# Tango with a Tracker (battlefield.tango_with_a_tracker#areas, Boneyard Gully): Area 2 (option 82): kill the Shikarees
# +6: event 32001 (2,1800,0,16,8,5). Then the Letter from Shikaree X again and area 3 (option 83, update 2,5,105): kill
# +12: event 32001 (3,16,1,16,8,5). Each finish changes nothing: the quest's 32001 (OtherAreas/TangoWithATracker.cs)
# completes it only when accepted with battlefieldWin set to the battlefield, and no char here has the quest accepted
# (the quest flows prove the completion).
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem LetterFromShikareeX
login
trigger _081
update 32000 option=82
finish
tick 2000
kill SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT+6
kill SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT+6
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
keyitem LetterFromShikareeX
trigger _081
update 32000 option=83
finish
tick 2000
kill SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT+12
kill SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT+12
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
